#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""asksoul — ask your Grok Bot main bot a question from a terminal.

The CLI opens a short-lived TCP listener, posts a webhook so the bot wakes,
and waits for the bot to dial back and answer over a signed, line-delimited
JSON protocol. Standard library only.
"""

